> That's it, if anyone is still reading this who doesn't want spoilers,
> sorry.  Alright, here's the question.  I know that dipping scrolls and
> spellbooks in potions of holy water will bless them (I think this is
> true, right?).  Is the same true of bags and other tools?

This not only goes for scrolls, books and tools, but for *every* item in
the dungeon, from rings to potions of water and from missile weapons to
iron chains. Anything cursed dipped in holy water will become uncursed,
anything uncursed will be blessed. Reversely, a potion of unholy water
will change anything blessed into uncursed and uncursed into cursed.

